---
type Props = {
	lang: 'es' | 'en';
};

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEs = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="po-screen" data-lang={lang}>
	<div class="po-shell">
		<div class="po-deck-card">
			<div class="po-nav-bar">
				<div class="po-slide-indicator">
					<span class="po-step-dot"></span>
					<span id="po-slide-label">SLIDE 1 / 8</span>
				</div>
				<div class="po-pills">
					<button class="po-pill-btn active" data-target-slide="1">1. {isEs ? 'Del procedimiento al objeto' : 'From procedure to object'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="2">2. {isEs ? 'Los 4 pilares' : 'The 4 pillars'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="3">3. {isEs ? 'Abstracción' : 'Abstraction'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="4">4. {isEs ? 'Encapsulamiento' : 'Encapsulation'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="5">5. {isEs ? 'Herencia' : 'Inheritance'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="6">6. {isEs ? 'Polimorfismo' : 'Polymorphism'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="7">7. {isEs ? 'Ejercicio' : 'Exercise'}</button>
					<button class="po-pill-btn" data-target-slide="8">8. {isEs ? 'Para llevarte' : 'Takeaways'}</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="po-viewport">
				<!-- SLIDE 1: FROM PROCEDURE TO OBJECT -->
				<div class="po-slide active" data-slide="1">
					<div class="po-slide-grid">
						<div class="po-col">
							<h2 class="po-slide-title">1. {isEs ? 'Del procedimiento al objeto' : 'From procedure to object'}</h2>
							<p class="po-text">
								{isEs
									? 'En la programación estructurada los datos y las funciones viven separados: cualquier función toca cualquier dato. En POO el programa es una red de objetos que protegen su propio estado y se comunican enviándose mensajes.'
									: 'In procedural programming, data and functions live apart: any function may touch any piece of data. In OOP the program is a network of objects that shield their own state and communicate by passing messages.'}
							</p>
							<div class="po-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 560 250" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Comparación entre programación estructurada y programación orientada a objetos' : 'Comparison between procedural programming and object-oriented programming'}>
									<rect x="6" y="34" width="224" height="204" rx="24" class="po-panel-weak" />
									<text x="18" y="24" class="po-svg-kicker">{isEs ? 'ESTRUCTURADA' : 'PROCEDURAL'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-wire">
										<path d="M62 92 L52 186" />
										<path d="M62 92 L118 186" />
										<path d="M62 92 L182 186" />
										<path d="M118 92 L52 186" />
										<path d="M118 92 L182 186" />
										<path d="M174 92 L52 186" />
										<path d="M174 92 L118 186" />
									</g>

									<g class="po-svg-fn">
										<rect x="30" y="64" width="64" height="28" rx="14" />
										<rect x="88" y="64" width="62" height="28" rx="14" />
										<rect x="146" y="64" width="64" height="28" rx="14" />
									</g>
									<text x="62" y="83" class="po-svg-chip">calcular()</text>
									<text x="119" y="83" class="po-svg-chip">imprimir()</text>
									<text x="178" y="83" class="po-svg-chip">guardar()</text>

									<g class="po-svg-data">
										<circle cx="52" cy="200" r="20" />
										<circle cx="118" cy="200" r="20" />
										<circle cx="182" cy="200" r="20" />
									</g>
									<text x="52" y="204" class="po-svg-chip-dark">saldo</text>
									<text x="118" y="204" class="po-svg-chip-dark">nombre</text>
									<text x="182" y="204" class="po-svg-chip-dark">edad</text>
									<text x="118" y="236" class="po-svg-note">{isEs ? 'datos globales · alto acoplamiento' : 'global data · high coupling'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-arrow">
										<path d="M244 136 H302" />
										<path d="M292 126 L304 136 L292 146 Z" />
									</g>

									<rect x="318" y="34" width="236" height="204" rx="24" class="po-panel-strong" />
									<text x="330" y="24" class="po-svg-kicker-2">{isEs ? 'ORIENTADA A OBJETOS' : 'OBJECT-ORIENTED'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-obj">
										<rect x="336" y="56" width="96" height="70" rx="18" />
										<rect x="446" y="56" width="96" height="70" rx="18" />
										<rect x="392" y="152" width="96" height="70" rx="18" />
									</g>
									<g class="po-svg-msg">
										<path d="M432 84 H446" />
										<path d="M440 126 L428 152" />
										<path d="M494 126 L470 152" />
									</g>

									<text x="384" y="78" class="po-svg-chip-dark">Cuenta</text>
									<text x="384" y="98" class="po-svg-state">- saldo</text>
									<text x="384" y="116" class="po-svg-method">+ depositar()</text>

									<text x="494" y="78" class="po-svg-chip-dark">Cliente</text>
									<text x="494" y="98" class="po-svg-state">- nombre</text>
									<text x="494" y="116" class="po-svg-method">+ getNombre()</text>

									<text x="440" y="174" class="po-svg-chip-dark">Banco</text>
									<text x="440" y="194" class="po-svg-state">- cuentas</text>
									<text x="440" y="212" class="po-svg-method">+ transferir()</text>

									<text x="436" y="236" class="po-svg-note">{isEs ? 'estado encapsulado · bajo acoplamiento' : 'encapsulated state · low coupling'}</text>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="po-col">
							<div class="po-card-box">
								<div class="po-card-head">{isEs ? 'DIFERENCIAS CLAVE' : 'KEY DIFFERENCES'}</div>
								<table class="po-table">
									<thead>
										<tr>
											<th>{isEs ? 'Criterio' : 'Criterion'}</th>
											<th>{isEs ? 'Estructurada' : 'Procedural'}</th>
											<th>POO / OOP</th>
										</tr>
									</thead>
									<tbody>
										<tr>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Enfoque' : 'Focus'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Funciones secuenciales' : 'Sequential functions'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Objetos con responsabilidades' : 'Objects with responsibilities'}</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Datos' : 'Data'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Compartidos globalmente' : 'Globally shared'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Encapsulados en el objeto' : 'Encapsulated in the object'}</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Acoplamiento' : 'Coupling'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Alto, con efectos colaterales' : 'High, with side effects'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Bajo, con alta cohesión' : 'Low, with high cohesion'}</td>
										</tr>
										<tr>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Mantenibilidad' : 'Maintainability'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Compleja al crecer' : 'Complex as it grows'}</td>
											<td>{isEs ? 'Escalable y reusable' : 'Scalable and reusable'}</td>
										</tr>
									</tbody>
								</table>
							</div>
							<div class="po-concept-box">
								<div class="po-concept-item">
									<strong class="po-accent-text">{isEs ? 'Objeto =' : 'Object ='}</strong>
									<span>{isEs ? 'estado (atributos) + comportamiento (métodos), en una sola unidad responsable de sí misma.' : 'state (fields) + behaviour (methods) in a single unit responsible for itself.'}</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 2: THE FOUR PILLARS -->
				<div class="po-slide" data-slide="2">
					<div class="po-sim-container">
						<h2 class="po-slide-title center">2. {isEs ? 'Los 4 pilares de la POO' : 'The 4 pillars of OOP'}</h2>
						<p class="po-sub center">{isEs ? 'Tocá un pilar para ir directo a su diapositiva.' : 'Tap a pillar to jump straight to its slide.'}</p>

						<div class="po-pillar-grid">
							<button class="po-pillar-btn" data-goto="3">
								<span class="po-pillar-icon">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z" />
										<path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5" />
										<path d="M12 22V12" />
									</svg>
								</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-name">{isEs ? 'Abstracción' : 'Abstraction'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-def">{isEs ? 'Quedarse solo con lo esencial del dominio.' : 'Keep only what matters to the domain.'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-index">01</span>
							</button>

							<button class="po-pillar-btn" data-goto="4">
								<span class="po-pillar-icon">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2" />
										<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
									</svg>
								</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-name">{isEs ? 'Encapsulamiento' : 'Encapsulation'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-def">{isEs ? 'Proteger el estado tras una interfaz pública.' : 'Shield state behind a public interface.'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-index">02</span>
							</button>

							<button class="po-pillar-btn" data-goto="5">
								<span class="po-pillar-icon">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<line x1="6" x2="6" y1="3" y2="15" />
										<circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3" />
										<circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3" />
										<path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9" />
									</svg>
								</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-name">{isEs ? 'Herencia' : 'Inheritance'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-def">{isEs ? 'Reutilizar una base con la relación “es un”.' : 'Reuse a base through the “is-a” relation.'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-index">03</span>
							</button>

							<button class="po-pillar-btn" data-goto="6">
								<span class="po-pillar-icon">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
										<path d="M2 18h2a4 4 0 0 0 3.3-1.7l5.4-8.6A4 4 0 0 1 16 6h6" />
										<path d="m18 2 4 4-4 4" />
										<path d="M2 6h2a4 4 0 0 1 3.3 1.8" />
										<path d="M22 18h-6a4 4 0 0 1-3.3-1.8" />
										<path d="m18 14 4 4-4 4" />
									</svg>
								</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-name">{isEs ? 'Polimorfismo' : 'Polymorphism'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-def">{isEs ? 'Una misma llamada, muchas implementaciones.' : 'One call, many implementations.'}</span>
								<span class="po-pillar-index">04</span>
							</button>
						</div>

						<div class="po-concept-box">
							<div class="po-concept-item">
								<strong class="po-accent-text">{isEs ? 'Cómo encajan:' : 'How they fit:'}</strong>
								<span>{isEs ? 'la abstracción decide qué modelar, el encapsulamiento protege ese modelo, la herencia lo extiende y el polimorfismo lo hace intercambiable.' : 'abstraction decides what to model, encapsulation protects that model, inheritance extends it and polymorphism makes it interchangeable.'}</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 3: ABSTRACTION -->
				<div class="po-slide" data-slide="3">
					<div class="po-slide-grid">
						<div class="po-col">
							<h2 class="po-slide-title">3. {isEs ? 'Abstracción' : 'Abstraction'}</h2>
							<p class="po-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Un auto real tiene miles de detalles. Para una gestión de flota solo importan unos pocos: la abstracción elige qué atributos y acciones entran en la clase y descarta el resto.'
									: 'A real car has thousands of details. A fleet-management system only cares about a few: abstraction picks which fields and actions enter the class and drops the rest.'}
							</p>
							<div class="po-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 560 230" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'De un auto real con muchos detalles a la clase Vehiculo' : 'From a real car with many details to the Vehiculo class'}>
									<circle cx="118" cy="112" r="92" class="po-panel-weak" />
									<text x="118" y="20" class="po-svg-kicker">{isEs ? 'AUTO REAL' : 'REAL CAR'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-detail">
										<rect x="34" y="42" width="98" height="24" rx="12" />
										<rect x="142" y="60" width="86" height="24" rx="12" />
										<rect x="16" y="96" width="92" height="24" rx="12" />
										<rect x="120" y="104" width="104" height="24" rx="12" />
										<rect x="36" y="146" width="96" height="24" rx="12" />
										<rect x="140" y="156" width="88" height="24" rx="12" />
									</g>
									<text x="83" y="58" class="po-svg-chip-dark">{isEs ? 'color' : 'colour'}</text>
									<text x="185" y="76" class="po-svg-chip-dark">{isEs ? 'tapizado' : 'upholstery'}</text>
									<text x="62" y="112" class="po-svg-chip-dark">patente</text>
									<text x="172" y="120" class="po-svg-chip-dark">{isEs ? 'n.º tornillos' : 'bolt count'}</text>
									<text x="84" y="162" class="po-svg-chip-dark">marca</text>
									<text x="184" y="172" class="po-svg-chip-dark">{isEs ? 'olor' : 'scent'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-arrow">
										<path d="M244 112 H302" />
										<path d="M292 102 L304 112 L292 122 Z" />
									</g>
									<text x="272" y="94" class="po-svg-note">{isEs ? 'abstraer' : 'abstract'}</text>

									<rect x="322" y="26" width="228" height="178" rx="22" class="po-panel-strong" />
									<path d="M322 62 H550" class="po-svg-rule" />
									<path d="M322 138 H550" class="po-svg-rule" />
									<text x="436" y="51" class="po-svg-uml-title">Vehiculo</text>
									<text x="340" y="84" class="po-svg-uml">- patente : String</text>
									<text x="340" y="106" class="po-svg-uml">- marca : String</text>
									<text x="340" y="128" class="po-svg-uml">- velocidadActual : double</text>
									<text x="340" y="162" class="po-svg-uml-m">+ acelerar(double) : void</text>
									<text x="340" y="186" class="po-svg-uml-m">+ getVelocidad() : double</text>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="po-col">
							<div class="po-code-card">
								<div class="po-code-title">Vehiculo.java</div>
								<pre class="po-code-block"><code><span class="po-c">// Only the fields fleet management needs</span>
<span class="po-k">public class</span> <span class="po-t">Vehiculo</span> &#123;
    <span class="po-k">private</span> <span class="po-t">String</span> patente;
    <span class="po-k">private</span> <span class="po-t">String</span> marca;
    <span class="po-k">private</span> <span class="po-t">double</span> velocidadActual;

    <span class="po-k">public void</span> acelerar(<span class="po-t">double</span> incremento) &#123;
        <span class="po-k">this</span>.velocidadActual += incremento;
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
							<div class="po-concept-box">
								<div class="po-concept-item">
									<strong class="po-accent-text">{isEs ? 'Regla práctica:' : 'Rule of thumb:'}</strong>
									<span>{isEs ? 'si un dato no se usa en ninguna decisión del sistema, no pertenece a la clase.' : 'if a piece of data drives no decision in the system, it does not belong in the class.'}</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 4: ENCAPSULATION -->
				<div class="po-slide" data-slide="4">
					<div class="po-slide-grid">
						<div class="po-col">
							<h2 class="po-slide-title">4. {isEs ? 'Encapsulamiento' : 'Encapsulation'}</h2>
							<p class="po-text">
								{isEs
									? 'El estado vive dentro de la cápsula y es privado. Las únicas puertas son los métodos públicos, que validan cada cambio antes de aplicarlo.'
									: 'State lives inside the capsule and is private. The only gates are the public methods, which validate every change before applying it.'}
							</p>
							<div class="po-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 560 190" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Cápsula con estado privado y métodos públicos como puertas' : 'Capsule with private state and public methods as gates'}>
									<rect x="130" y="24" width="300" height="142" rx="70" class="po-panel-strong" />
									<rect x="164" y="56" width="232" height="78" rx="34" class="po-panel-core" />
									<text x="280" y="86" class="po-svg-chip-dark">private double saldo</text>
									<text x="280" y="112" class="po-svg-note">{isEs ? 'nadie lo toca desde afuera' : 'untouchable from outside'}</text>

									<g class="po-svg-gate">
										<rect x="10" y="44" width="108" height="30" rx="15" />
										<rect x="10" y="112" width="108" height="30" rx="15" />
										<rect x="442" y="78" width="108" height="30" rx="15" />
									</g>
									<text x="64" y="64" class="po-svg-chip">depositar()</text>
									<text x="64" y="132" class="po-svg-chip">retirar()</text>
									<text x="496" y="98" class="po-svg-chip">getSaldo()</text>

									<g class="po-svg-arrow">
										<path d="M118 59 H158" />
										<path d="M150 51 L160 59 L150 67 Z" />
										<path d="M118 127 H158" />
										<path d="M150 119 L160 127 L150 135 Z" />
										<path d="M402 93 H440" />
										<path d="M432 85 L442 93 L432 101 Z" />
									</g>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="po-col">
							<div class="po-demo">
								<div class="po-card-head">CuentaBancaria — {isEs ? 'DEMO INTERACTIVA' : 'INTERACTIVE DEMO'}</div>
								<div class="po-readout">
									<span class="po-readout-label">getSaldo()</span>
									<span class="po-readout-value" id="po-bank-balance">300</span>
								</div>
								<div class="po-bar"><span class="po-bar-fill" id="po-bank-bar"></span></div>
								<div class="po-demo-btns">
									<button class="po-btn-demo" id="po-bank-deposit">depositar(100)</button>
									<button class="po-btn-demo" id="po-bank-withdraw">retirar(500)</button>
									<button class="po-btn-demo po-btn-quiet" id="po-bank-reset">{isEs ? 'reiniciar' : 'reset'}</button>
								</div>
								<p class="po-log" id="po-bank-log">{isEs ? 'Probá los métodos públicos: el saldo solo cambia si la validación pasa.' : 'Try the public methods: the balance only changes when validation passes.'}</p>
							</div>
							<div class="po-code-card">
								<div class="po-code-title">CuentaBancaria.java</div>
								<pre class="po-code-block"><code><span class="po-k">private</span> <span class="po-t">double</span> saldo;

<span class="po-k">public void</span> retirar(<span class="po-t">double</span> monto) &#123;
    <span class="po-k">if</span> (monto &gt; <span class="po-n">0</span> &amp;&amp; monto &lt;= <span class="po-k">this</span>.saldo) &#123;
        <span class="po-k">this</span>.saldo -= monto;
    &#125; <span class="po-k">else</span> &#123;
        <span class="po-c">// invalid request: state stays untouched</span>
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 5: INHERITANCE -->
				<div class="po-slide" data-slide="5">
					<div class="po-slide-grid">
						<div class="po-col po-col-wide">
							<h2 class="po-slide-title">5. {isEs ? 'Herencia' : 'Inheritance'}</h2>
							<p class="po-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Una subclase obtiene con extends el estado y el comportamiento de su superclase, y llama a super(...) para inicializar la parte heredada. Avanzá paso a paso para ver qué recibe cada hija.'
									: 'A subclass gains its superclass state and behaviour through extends, and calls super(...) to initialise the inherited part. Step through to see what each child receives.'}
							</p>
							<div class="po-demo-btns">
								<button class="po-btn-demo" id="po-inherit-btn">{isEs ? 'Revelar lo heredado →' : 'Reveal what is inherited →'}</button>
								<span class="po-step-chip" id="po-inherit-step">{isEs ? 'Paso 0 / 3 — solo miembros propios' : 'Step 0 / 3 — own members only'}</span>
							</div>
							<div class="po-figure" id="po-inherit-figure" data-step="0">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 560 300" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Jerarquía Dispositivo, Telefono y Laptop' : 'Dispositivo, Telefono and Laptop hierarchy'}>
									<rect x="168" y="12" width="224" height="104" rx="22" class="po-panel-strong" />
									<path d="M168 44 H392" class="po-svg-rule" />
									<path d="M168 74 H392" class="po-svg-rule" />
									<text x="280" y="34" class="po-svg-uml-title">Dispositivo</text>
